{
  "key": 39276,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_CandiceIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "You want to challenge Candice?\r",
        "Sure thing!\n",
        "I was waiting for someone tough!\r",
        "But I should tell you, I’m tough\n",
        "because I know how to focus.\r",
        "Pokémon, fashion, romance...\n",
        "It’s all about focus!\r",
        "I’ll show you just what I mean.\n",
        "Get ready to lose!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu veux me défier?\r",
        "Bien sûr!\n",
        "J’attendais un Dresseur coriace!\r",
        "Laisse-moi te dire une chose, je tire ma\n",
        "force de ma concentration.\r",
        "Les Pokémon, la mode, l’amour...\n",
        "C’est une question de concentration!\r",
        "Je vais t’en faire la démonstration.\n",
        "Tu peux numéroter tes abattis!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_BeatCandice",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! You’re great!\n",
        "You’ve earned my respect!\r",
        "I think your focus and will bowled\n",
        "us over totally.\r",
        "Oh, that’s right!\n",
        "I’m supposed to give you this!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Waouh! Tu es fantastique!\n",
        "Tu viens de gagner mon respect!\r",
        "J’étais stupéfaite par ta\n",
        "concentration et ta volonté.\r",
        "Oh, c’est vrai!\n",
        "Je suis censée te remettre ceci!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_CandiceReceiveIciclebadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Icicle Badge from Candice."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient le\n",
        "Badge Glaçon de Gladys."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_CandiceExplainIcicleBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "That Icicle Badge I just gave you?\r",
        "Because you have it, you can use the\n",
        "hidden move Rock Climb anytime, even\f",
        "when you’re not in a battle.\r",
        "Oh, and take this, too.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu sais, ce Badge Glaçon\n",
        "que je viens de te donner?\r",
        "Grâce à lui, tu peux utiliser la capacité\n",
        "secrète Escalade quand tu veux,\f",
        "même en dehors du combat.\r",
        "Oh, j’allais oublier ça.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_CandiceExplainTM72",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contains the move\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "If the user takes damage, the move’s\n",
        "power is doubled!\r",
        "Can you imagine what sort of focus\n",
        "you’d need to pull it off?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contient la capacité\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Si le lanceur subit des dégâts, la\n",
        "puissance de la capacité est doublée!\r",
        "Tu réalises la concentration que\n",
        "cela implique?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_CandiceAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you think I should try to act\n",
        "more like an Ice-type Gym Leader?\r",
        "Like, do you think I should be more\n",
        "cool and distant?\r",
        "That sort of thing I have trouble\n",
        "with."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu crois que je devrais me comporter\n",
        "comme un Champion de type Glace?\r",
        "Genre, être froide et distante?\r",
        "Ce n’est pas dans mon caractère..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_GymGuideBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, there!\n",
        "How’s it going, Champ-to-be?\r",
        "Do you see the big snowballs placed\n",
        "here and there?\r",
        "You need to slide on the ice with\n",
        "enough momentum to crush them.\r",
        "The Gym Leader is a user of\n",
        "Ice-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Melt her defenses with scorching-\n",
        "hot Fire-type moves!\r",
        "It’s all about focus with this Gym.\n",
        "Bear down and focus!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, toi! Comment ça va? Tu veux devenir\n",
        "le Maître de la Ligue Pokémon, non?\r",
        "Tu as vu les grosses boules de neige\n",
        "placées ici et là?\r",
        "Tu dois glisser sur la glace à une\n",
        "vitesse suffisante pour les pulvériser.\r",
        "Le Champion d’Arène utilise des Pokémon\n",
        "de type Glace.\r",
        "Fais fondre ses défenses grâce à des\n",
        "capacités brûlantes de type Feu!\r",
        "Ici, tout est une question de\n",
        "concentration. Garde la tête froide!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_GymGuideAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve beaten the Gym Leader!\r",
        "You were more focused than her,\n",
        "and your Pokémon picked up on it!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Tu as vaincu le Champion d’Arène!\r",
        "Ta concentration a fait la différence,\n",
        "tu as montré l’exemple à tes Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_GymStatueBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Candice\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Arène Pokémon de Frimapic\r",
        "Champion: Gladys\n",
        "Nouveau Dresseur reconnu:\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointGym_Text_GymStatueAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Candice\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Arène Pokémon de Frimapic\r",
        "Champion: Gladys\n",
        "Nouveaux Dresseurs reconnus:\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
